#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_two_axes
#! frames  170
#! poster  20
# --check: the plotted values depend on the host, not the compiler (the same pixels on CI with gfortran 14.3 and
# 16.2, none here; likely libm's results, by glibc version or CPU): on CI 1 pixel(s) over 2, measured
# 2026-11-12; 8 allowed, the threshold unchanged
#! check   max_failed=8
# zoom in on the plot with the wheel: both y axes follow their own data range; then drag the right (Y2) axis alone
0   move 450 250
10  move 420 260 15
30  wheel 0 1
40  wheel 0 1
50  wheel 0 1
60  wheel 0 -1
70  wheel 0 -1
80  wheel 0 -1
95  move 760 260 15
115 down
120 move 760 330 20
145 up
